(6621934, 988974, 97225, '<td valign="top">Poor lion looks pooped.</td>', 'Poor lion looks pooped.', '2011-12-19 19:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6621972, 988800, 10785, '<td valign="top">A nice coastal type scene. Though the flag pole is metal, it is shot in a way that does not make that fact stand out as the purpose of the shot. As far as the B&amp;W, it is lacking in tonal range consisting mostly of mid tones. The halo-ing also suggests over sharpening was performed.</td>', 'A nice coastal type scene. Though the flag pole is metal, it is shot in a way that does not make that fact stand out as the purpose of the shot. As far as the B&W, it is lacking in tonal range consisting mostly of mid tones. The halo-ing also suggests over sharpening was performed.', '2011-12-19 20:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6621975, 988999, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s a kind of gritty shot which is ok to me. I like how the yellow stands out so much. It does suffer from either oversharpening or bad resizing as shown by the jpg artifacts along practically every line on the car.</td>', 'It''s a kind of gritty shot which is ok to me. I like how the yellow stands out so much. It does suffer from either oversharpening or bad resizing as shown by the jpg artifacts along practically every line on the car.', '2011-12-19 20:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6621978, 988932, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like that it is all brown, including the background. Good eye for simplicity in the shot. It is fairly soft in focus due to camera shake or missed focus. More than likely it was missed focus due to the autofocus not functioning because of the ingle color and lack of any good contrast.</td>', 'I like that it is all brown, including the background. Good eye for simplicity in the shot. It is fairly soft in focus due to camera shake or missed focus. More than likely it was missed focus due to the autofocus not functioning because of the ingle color and lack of any good contrast.', '2011-12-19 20:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6621989, 989065, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good line along the spine of the metal beast, but not much of interest shown. I would suggest getting closer and making it more abstract by eliminating the background. Depth of field doesn''t really reveal a focal point either.</td>', 'Good line along the spine of the metal beast, but not much of interest shown. I would suggest getting closer and making it more abstract by eliminating the background. Depth of field doesn''t really reveal a focal point either.', '2011-12-19 20:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6621993, 989059, 10785, '<td valign="top">This would be much better with a more interesting sky.</td>', 'This would be much better with a more interesting sky.', '2011-12-19 20:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6621997, 988892, 10785, '<td valign="top">The bridge detail is all in shadow which eliminates the metal subject and makes this shot more about the sky and ocean than the pier.</td>', 'The bridge detail is all in shadow which eliminates the metal subject and makes this shot more about the sky and ocean than the pier.', '2011-12-19 20:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622000, 988981, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good eye on the composition using the diagonal line and placing the guts on the control stand in the third. It does lack color and contrast and much of the stand is in shadow due to the bright sky. A little pop of color in the stand would have been nice but was probably not possible. Perhaps a nice twilight sky to add some orange color could have helped...</td>', 'Good eye on the composition using the diagonal line and placing the guts on the control stand in the third. It does lack color and contrast and much of the stand is in shadow due to the bright sky. A little pop of color in the stand would have been nice but was probably not possible. Perhaps a nice twilight sky to add some orange color could have helped...', '2011-12-19 20:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622001, 988988, 10785, '<td valign="top">The light captured in the pipe is awesome!</td>', 'The light captured in the pipe is awesome!', '2011-12-19 20:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
