(6625509, 988826, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love this.  I wish there was some way to isolate it a bit more, maybe darken the surroundings?  Great find.</td>', 'I love this.  I wish there was some way to isolate it a bit more, maybe darken the surroundings?  Great find.', '2011-12-26 00:23:14.000000', NULL, 0),
