(6625526, 989078, 139321, '<td valign="top">Well i didnt really expect a high score but 76th was kinda shocking. Oh well stick to my heart with my style learn frm my mistakes and keep drudging ahead. Maybe i shouldnt take auch a literal meaning to a challenge and just make it loose interpretation as this seems the only way to score. Cheers to all and thanx for the helpful comments</td>', 'Well i didnt really expect a high score but 76th was kinda shocking. Oh well stick to my heart with my style learn frm my mistakes and keep drudging ahead. Maybe i shouldnt take auch a literal meaning to a challenge and just make it loose interpretation as this seems the only way to score. Cheers to all and thanx for the helpful comments', '2011-12-26 00:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6625527, 989054, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love that the sunset reflection is sharper than the real thing.  Never saw a commenter score like that.  You ARE unique!</td>', 'I love that the sunset reflection is sharper than the real thing.  Never saw a commenter score like that.  You ARE unique!', '2011-12-26 00:28:22.000000', NULL, 0),
