(6626157, 989076, 69008, '<td valign="top">Hi Judi! This is a nice "out of the box" shot, not at all your normal style. I like the creamy color in this personally but feel that it would have scored higher as a B&amp;W. The paint completely covers the metal, and makes it look as though it might be plastic in this one. <br/> I admire that you probably knew that this would not ribbon, but shared it with us anyway.</td>', 'Hi Judi! This is a nice "out of the box" shot, not at all your normal style. I like the creamy color in this personally but feel that it would have scored higher as a B&W. The paint completely covers the metal, and makes it look as though it might be plastic in this one.  I admire that you probably knew that this would not ribbon, but shared it with us anyway.', '2011-12-27 01:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
